### Implementation Update: TaskForge Refinement Loop

#### 1. Goal
Extend TaskForge to support a refinement loop for improving existing tasks based on user-provided feedback, while preserving iteration history through versioned task copies or history logs. This builds on the CLI skeleton (Task 1), task model with persistence (Task 2), listing/filtering (Task 3), complete/delete flows (Task 4), gate summarizer (Task 5), AI-assisted decomposition (Task 6), code snippet generation (Task 7), and automated tests (Task 8). It enhances baseline mode for the RazorCascade memory reliability study by enabling iterative task evolution with traceable history, improving memory efficiency in feedback-driven workflows.

#### 2. Proposed Implementation Details
